# 🏗️ 2. REAL PRODUCTION ARCHITECTURE (DEVOPS STYLE)

---

## 🔐 SCENARIO: Enterprise system

You have:

* 🖥️ Developer machine (your laptop)
* 🖥️ Bastion server (public entry point)
* 🖥️ App server (private)
* 🖥️ DB server (fully private)

---

## 🔄 ARCHITECTURE FLOW

```text id="p1"
INTERNET
   ↓
BASTION SERVER (SSH only)
   ↓
APPLICATION SERVER
   ↓
DATABASE (private, no public access)
```

---

# 🟢 LOCAL PORT FORWARDING IN PRODUCTION

### Use case:

👉 Access private DB safely

```text id="p2"
Laptop → Bastion → DB (5432)
```

### Why used:

* DB is NOT exposed publicly
* Only SSH tunnel allowed

✔ Most common enterprise pattern

---

# 🔵 REMOTE PORT FORWARDING IN PRODUCTION

### Use case 1: IoT / edge devices

```text id="p3"
IoT Device (behind NAT)
   ↓
SSH tunnel
   ↓
Cloud server port exposed
```

✔ Device cannot accept inbound traffic
✔ It “calls home” using `-R`

---

### Use case 2: Developer sharing local app

```text id="p4"
Developer Laptop → Server → Team accesses app
```

✔ Quick demo / testing

