# 🔐 3. REAL COMPANY USE CASES

---

## 🟢 LOCAL FORWARDING USED FOR:

✔ Database access (PostgreSQL, MySQL)
✔ Internal dashboards (Grafana, Kibana)
✔ Kubernetes API access
✔ Admin panels

---

## 🔵 REMOTE FORWARDING USED FOR:

✔ IoT devices behind firewall
✔ Remote debugging
✔ Sharing local dev environment
✔ Reverse access to NAT systems

