# 🧱 4. SECURITY MODEL (VERY IMPORTANT)

| Method                    | Security       |
| ------------------------- | -------------- |
| Open DB port              | ❌ Unsafe       |
| Port forwarding (-L / -R) | ✔ Secure       |
| VPN                       | ✔✔ Enterprise  |
| Bastion + SSH             | ✔✔ Most common |

---

# 🧠 5. KEY CONCEPTS (INTERVIEW READY)

### ✔ SSH tunnel is NOT a service

It is just a secure pipe.

### ✔ No ports are “opened publicly”

Only SSH (22) is used.

### ✔ Forwarding is temporary

Stops when SSH disconnects.

